    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to build your dream music studio? <strong>Hitmaker Tycoon</strong> puts you at the heart of the music production world in an immersive simulation experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey in an era of simple instruments and watch as music technology evolves over the years. From the analog devices of the 70s to the digital revolution of the 2000s, upgrade your tools, explore new genres, and create legendary albums.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own studio, discover talented musicians, and invest in the best equipment. Stay ahead of the trends, pioneer new music styles, and climb to the top of the charts to leave your mark in music history. Experience the evolution of music production, from cassette tapes to AI-powered tools of the modern age!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Hitmaker Tycoon</strong>, you're not just making music; you're crafting your legacy as a music genius while shaping the global music industry. The future will be written with your melodies. Are you ready?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to build your dream music studio? <strong>Hitmaker Tycoon</strong> puts you at the heart of the music production world in an immersive simulation experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey in an era of simple instruments and watch as music technology evolves over the years. From the analog devices of the 70s to the digital revolution of the 2000s, upgrade your tools, explore new genres, and create legendary albums.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own studio, discover talented musicians, and invest in the best equipment. Stay ahead of the trends, pioneer new music styles, and climb to the top of the charts to leave your mark in music history. Experience the evolution of music production, from cassette tapes to AI-powered tools of the modern age!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Hitmaker Tycoon</strong>, you're not just making music; you're crafting your legacy as a music genius while shaping the global music industry. The future will be written with your melodies. Are you ready?</p>",
